<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Done</title></head>
<body style="font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">
<h2>安装完成</h2>
<p>可在「应用程序」中打开 <b>OpenConnect Gui</b>。</p>
<p>若提示无法打开，请右键 → 打开，或在终端执行：</p>
<pre>xattr -cr "/Applications/OpenConnect Gui.app"</pre>
<p>配置目录：<code>~/Library/Application Support/OpenConnectGui/</code></p>
</body>
</html>
